      "value": "<p>When you reach <strong>4th Level</strong>, and again at <strong>8th, 12th, 16th,</strong> and <strong>19th Level</strong>, you have 3 points to distribute into your <strong>Ability Scores</strong>. You can't increase an <strong>Ability Score</strong> above your <em>Ability Score Maximum</em> using this feature. Alternatively, you may instead gain a <strong>Feat</strong> for the cost of 2 points.</p>\n",
